#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:56
#: 39425131f6674b67b05f7366213eb263
msgid "VTOL Motor Ordering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:58
#: e5ddc9ab99224b1c97d06d68068e4783
msgid "The motor order and output channel is the same as for copter (see :ref:`Copter motor layout <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`) except that the default output channel numbers usually start at 5 instead of 1, since the basic plane control surfaces are usually setup by default already on outputs 1 thru 4 when Q_ENABLE is set to 1 and the autopilot rebooted to setup QuadPlane."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:61
#: e4e1721a56a644a496d2d79ef8404444
msgid ":ref:`guide-tailsitter` configuration is a special case. See Tailsitter notes below"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:63
#: 490b575bc61d4f0daf93502ac74a1b99
msgid "For example, with the default Quad-X frame the motors are on outputs 5 to 8. The arrangement is:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:66
#: 94190bade4e843ddb6ea293b8bbd06ed
msgid "**Output 5:** Motor 1 - Front right motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:67
#: 8f0a7868abe743bc8b6dc347e4c81460
msgid "**Output 6:** Motor 2 - Rear left motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:68
#: 590f89d463b24fb3b13b863d5cbf55b9
msgid "**Output 7:** Motor 3 - Front left motor, clockwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:69
#: 2925bdb1eb4148b1bc8ca5ad107677d6
msgid "**Output 8:** Motor 4 - Rear right motor, clockwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:71
#: 4b892b1a1c4340ea91406db914dd4b28
msgid "You can remember the clockwise/counter-clockwise rule by \"motors turn in towards the fuselage\", except for the H configuration, there all directions are inverted!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:74
#: aec33be1eedb4715acfd5a2941818190
msgid "Another common setup is an OctoQuad X8, which uses the following ordering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:76
#: 6c53ca0802c24259b29ae0536622b1d2
msgid "**Output 5:** Motor 1 - Front right top motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:77
#: f46b1d8eae944eb7bb1b11436a2d9b4c
