#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:82
#: 5f0316b7be9049acb62636dbf0187fc2
msgid "**Output 11:** Motor 7 - Rear right bottom motor, counter-clockwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:83
#: d0d720be5fb049609b48b9af999cd8ec
msgid "**Output 12:** Motor 8 - Rear left bottom motor, clockwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-frame-setup.rst:85
#: fcce3d43019d41f989aac105dc690971
msgid "You can remember the clockwise/counter-clockwise rule for an octa-quad by \"top motors turn in towards the fuselage, bottom motors turn out away from the fuselage\"."
